      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It swims as fast as a jet boat. The edges of its\nwings are sharp and can slice apart drifting ice.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ジェットスキーに　負けない　速度で\n泳ぐ。翼の　縁は　鋭く\n流氷を　切断する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
